## __Vendor__

Set `translation.service.name` to `__Vendor__`.

### Config keys

| Key | Where | Description |
|---|---|---|
| `translation.service.name` | translate config | `__Vendor__` |
| `translation.service.all.env` | translate config | Environments offered in the Options step, for example `stage, prod` |
| `translation.service.<env>.__key__` | translate config | TODO |
| `translation.service.<env>.__secret__` | credential sheet (`translation.service.key.path`) | TODO: never put secrets in the translate config |
| `translation.service.supports.duedate` | translate config | `true` shows a due date field (only if the vendor supports it) |
| `translation.service.custom.<type>.<name>` | translate config | TODO, only if the connector uses custom attributes |

